gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-e6[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Store both prompt renderings and linkify xprompt references[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every SASE agent chat markdown file and every published prompt [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]archive entry stores both the unrendered XPrompt prompt and the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]rendered agent prompt, and every resolvable xprompt reference [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]inside an unrendered prompt renders as a Markdown hyperlink to the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]hosted file that defines it, including chezmoi-managed definitions [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]when `use_chezmoi: true`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]stored_prompt_duality.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/stored_prompt_duality.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-e6[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-e6/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust xprompt-source wire and reference link rewriting[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add the `prompt_xprompt` module to sase_core with the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]launch-capture record wire, newest-per-reference selection, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]boundary-aware reference rewriter that shares the artifact rewriter's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]literal-zone and Markdown-link protection, plus the sase_core_py [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bindings and Rust tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Launch-time capture of xprompt definition provenance[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]capture[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture: write the per-run `xprompt_sources.json` artifact recording [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]each surviving reference's exact token and its owning repository, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]repo-relative path, chezmoi remapping, and definition line, resolved [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]best-effort so a launch never fails because provenance was unavailable.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hosted URL resolution for xprompt definitions[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]links[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, capture[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]links: add the resolver that turns one captured provenance record into a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hosted blob URL with a line anchor, pinning the primary repository at [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the publication revision and returning nothing rather than guessing.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Chat markdown stores both prompt renderings[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chat[dim] · [dim][/dim]after links[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chat: extend the chat writer with sentinel-delimited XPrompt and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rendered-prompt sections, harden turn parsing against them, update every[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`save_chat_history` caller to supply both renderings, and linkify [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]references in the stored XPrompt section.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prompt archive stores both prompt renderings[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]archive[dim] · [dim][/dim]after links[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]archive: linkify xprompt references in the published prompt body, append[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the rendered prompt as a collapsed verbatim section, and extend prompt [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]archive validation and the sidecar README template to cover both.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Read surfaces, docs, and end-to-end verification[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]surfaces[dim] · [dim][/dim]after chat, archive[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]surfaces: teach the ACE chat detail view and the `sase agent prompts [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]show` / `sase chat show` commands about the two renderings, update the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documentation, and verify the whole path end to end.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-e6","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-e6.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-fd4ed678543943ff69caf896b73a0aa6","started_at":"2026-08-02T13:26:55.718437+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-e6","bbugyi200.athena.sase-e6.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-e6.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-e6.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-e6.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-e6.5","bbugyi200.athena.sase-e6.6","bbugyi200.athena.sase-e6.land"]}
